# Sound effects
@scenario tutorial_lesson_06
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char ginger global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: That envelope could use a doorbell. Listen to this sound and imagine it just before the letter arrives.
[sfx assets/tutorial/welcome.wav]
ginger: Find welcome.wav in assets/tutorial. Replay the example to hear it again.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
ginger: Which command fits a short sound effect?
> bgm -> retry
> sfx -> correct
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: A one-shot sound can finish while the scene continues. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: A one-shot sound can finish while the scene continues.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_06]
[flag tutorial_done_06]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_3]
